      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "And I've been passing a lot of urine as well, since Friday. Ah, with passing a lot of urine, I'd call it moderate. As for vomiting, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. With vomiting, it happens on and off.",
